"<div id=""mindx-private-practice-marketing-checklist"">

<h2>Private Practice Marketing Checklist</h2>

<div class=""subtitle"">
Build a consistent marketing system that helps prospective clients find, understand, and connect with your practice.
</div>

<form id=""marketingChecklist"">

<div class=""section"">
<h3>Brand & Positioning</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have clearly defined the population I want to serve.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have identified my primary areas of focus or specialties.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My practice name and professional branding are consistent.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I can clearly explain what makes my practice different.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Online Presence</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My professional website is published and up to date.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My website clearly explains who I work with and how I help.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My website includes an easy way to contact or schedule a consultation.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My website is mobile-friendly.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My professional contact information is consistent across platforms.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Directory Profiles</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My Psychology Today profile is complete and current.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My profile clearly identifies my ideal client population.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My profile uses language that prospective clients can easily understand.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My professional photo is current and appropriate.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Referral Network</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have identified potential referral sources.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have introduced my practice to relevant healthcare or community professionals.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have a simple way for referral sources to contact me.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I follow up with referral sources appropriately.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Content & Visibility</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have identified useful topics related to my practice focus.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have a realistic content schedule.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My content provides useful psychoeducation without compromising client privacy.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I maintain appropriate professional boundaries on social media.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Conversion & Follow-Up</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> Prospective clients can easily request a consultation.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My consultation process is clearly explained.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I have a consistent process for responding to inquiries.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I track where new inquiries are coming from.</label>

</div>


<div class=""section"">
<h3>Ongoing Review</h3>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I periodically review my website and directory profiles.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I monitor which marketing channels generate inquiries.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> I update my messaging as my practice evolves.</label>

<label><input type=""checkbox""> My marketing activities are sustainable for my current workload.</label>

</div>


<button type=""button"" onclick=""calculateMarketing()"">
Review Marketing Readiness
</button>

</form>

<div id=""marketingResults""></div>

<div class=""note"">
This checklist is for practice-planning and marketing education only. Marketing requirements, professional advertising rules, and privacy obligations may vary by state, license, payer, and professional board.
</div>

</div>


